-## Local Development Setup
-
-### Prerequisites
-
-- **Node.js** v18 or later
-- **npm** v9 or later
-- **Redis** (local install or Docker)
-- **Firebase project** with Realtime Database enabled
-- **Service account key** (place at `bot/service-account.json`)
