-### Steps
-
-```bash
-# 1. Clone repository
-git clone https://github.com/nexorasoftwareagency-rgb/Foodhubbie-project.git
-cd Foodhubbie-project
-
-# 2. Install bot dependencies
-cd bot
-npm install
-
-# 3. Set up Firebase service account
-# Download from Firebase Console → Project Settings → Service Accounts
-# Save as bot/service-account.json
-
-# 4. Start Redis (if using Docker)
-docker run -d -p 6379:6379 redis:7
-
-# 5. Start the bot
-OUTLET=pizza node bot/index.js
-# Scan QR code with WhatsApp
