-| `WA_PERMANENT_TOKEN` | `/var/www/foodhubbie/.env` | System User token from Section 5.5 |
-| `WA_VERIFY_TOKEN` | `/var/www/foodhubbie/.env` | Any random string, must match Meta dashboard exactly |
